{"author_id": "1637507099558027267", "conversation_id": "2098900961888509971", "created_at": "2026-09-12T22:25:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2098900961888509971"], "id": "2098900961888509971", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1704, "impression_count": 188173, "like_count": 4201, "quote_count": 79, "reply_count": 85, "retweet_count": 587}, "text": "A few years back, a friend of mine looked into the 2018 American National Election Study pilot, and he found that every racial group felt warmth towards members of their own race, except for White liberals\n\nI wanted to see if that replicated and expand on it\ud83e\uddf5\n\n#1: It replicates https://t.co/xt3JlJkqGQ", "username": "cremieuxrecueil", "author_followers": 334583}
